ogin Pro to restore LDAP login.'=>'更新已停止。激活 Simple LDAP Login Pro 以恢复 LDAP 登录。','Update blocked: This package does not include all Pro files. To install Free, deactivate the plugin first. Your installed files and settings are unchanged.'=>'更新被阻止：此包不包含所有 Pro 文件。要安装免费版，请先停用插件。您已安装的文件和设置保持不变。','WordPress could not reactivate the plugin.'=>'WordPress无法重新激活插件。','Simple LDAP Login needs PHP 8.1 or later.'=>'Simple LDAP Login需要PHP 8.1或更高版本。','Plugin files are missing. Reinstall Simple LDAP Login from the release ZIP.'=>'插件文件丢失。从发布ZIP重新安装Simple LDAP Login。','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'您没有权限更改这些设置。','The settings scope has changed. Open the settings page and try again.'=>'设置范围已更改。打开设置页面并重试。','You do not have permission to view these settings.'=>'您没有权限查看这些设置。','Network settings'=>'网络设置','Site settings'=>'站点设置','LDAP login settings'=>'LDAP登录设置','Connect to LDAP, then test a login before enabling authentication.'=>'连接到LDAP，然后在启用身份验证之前测试登录。','LDAP login and SSO are disabled by SLL_DISABLE_LDAP in wp-config.php.'=>'LDAP登录和SSO因wp-config.php中的SLL_DISABLE_LDAP而被禁用。','Your saved settings use SSO or custom user fields. Install Simple LDAP Login Pro to use these features. Your settings are kept.'=>'您的保存设置使用SSO或自定义用户字段。安装Simple LDAP Login Pro以使用这些功能。您的设置已保存。','The saved LDAP search password cannot be read. Enter it again on the Connection tab.'=>'无法读取保存的LDAP搜索密码。在连接选项卡上重新输入。','PHP LDAP is missing. Ask your host to install it before enabling LDAP login.'=>'缺少 PHP LDAP。请向您的主机请求安装它，然后再启用 LDAP 登录。','LDAP passwords are sent without encryption. Use StartTLS or LDAPS if your server supports it.'=>'LDAP 密码以未加密的方式发送。如果您的服务器支持，请使用 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','Save settings'=>'保存设置','Settings on other tabs are kept.'=>'其他选项卡上的设置将被保留。','LDAP connection'=>'LDAP 连接','LDAP login'=>'LDAP 登录','Enable LDAP authentication.'=>'启用 LDAP 身份验证。','Directory type'=>'目录类型','Active Directory'=>'Active Directory','OpenLDAP / other LDAP directory'=>'OpenLDAP / 其他 LDAP 目录','LDAP servers'=>'LDAP 服务