ress administrator password, then restore the folder and correct the settings.'=>'如果您被锁定，请使用您的主机文件管理器重命名 simple-ldap-login 文件夹。使用 WordPress 管理员密码登录，然后恢复文件夹并更正设置。','For certificate errors, ask your host to configure the trusted LDAP certificate authority.'=>'对于证书错误，请要求您的主机配置受信任的 LDAP 证书颁发机构。','LDAP tests'=>'LDAP 测试','Tests use saved settings.'=>'测试使用保存的设置。','1. Test connection'=>'1. 测试连接','Connect to LDAP and test the search account, if set.'=>'连接到 LDAP 并测试搜索账户（如果设置）。','Test connection'=>'测试连接','2. Test login'=>'2. 测试登录','Check an LDAP username, password, and group membership.'=>'检查 LDAP 用户名、密码和组成员资格。','LDAP username'=>'LDAP 用户名','LDAP password'=>'LDAP 密码','Settings saved.'=>'设置已保存。','Connection test passed.'=>'连接测试通过。','Cannot connect to LDAP. Check the server, port, TLS certificate, and search account.'=>'无法连接到 LDAP。检查服务器、端口、TLS 证书和搜索账户。','LDAP login test passed. No account was created.'=>'LDAP 登录测试通过。未创建账户。','LDAP login test failed. Check the username, password, and required groups.'=>'LDAP 登录测试失败。检查用户名、密码和所需组。','Could not save settings. Check the values and try again.'=>'无法保存设置。检查值并重试。','Connection'=>'连接','Access'=>'访问','Advanced'=>'高级','Troubleshooting'=>'故障排除','Your LDAP login is valid, but you need a WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 登录有效，但您需要一个 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Your LDAP username is not a valid WordPress username. Contact your site administrator.'=>'您的 LDAP 用户名不是有效的 WordPress 用户名。请联系您的网站管理员。','The default WordPress role is not available. Contact your site administrator.'=>'默认的 WordPress 角色不可用。请联系您的网站管理员。','Could not create your WordPress account. Contact your site administrator.'=>'无法创建您的 WordPress 账户。请联系您的网站管理员。','Use your WordPress password for this recovery account.'=>'使用您的 WordPress 密码作为此恢复账户。','LDAP login failed. Check your username and password or contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登录失败。检查您的用户名和密码或联系您的网站管理员。','Your account is not allowed to log in to this site.'=>'您的账户不允许登录此站点。','LDAP login is unavailable. Contact your site administrator.'=>'LDAP 登录不可用。请联系您的站点管理员。','PHP OpenSSL is required to save the LDAP search password.'=>'需要 PHP OpenSSL 来保存 LDAP 搜索密码。','Could not read or save the LDAP search password. Enter it again. If this continues, ask your host to check OpenSSL and the encryption key.'=>'无法读取或保存 LDAP 搜索密码。请重新输入。如果问题持续，请让您的主机检查 OpenSSL 和加密密钥。','Select a recovery account on the Access tab, or turn local recovery access Off.'=>'在访问选项卡上选择一个恢复账户，或关闭本地恢复访问。','Enable Allow unencrypted LDAP on the Advanced tab, or choose StartTLS or LDAPS.'=>'在高级选项卡上启用允许未加密的 LDAP，或选择 StartTLS 或 LDAPS。','A custom field mapping uses a protected or invalid WordPress user meta key.'=>'自定义字段映射使用了受保护或无效的 WordPress 用户元数据键。','Enter a Base DN and at least one LDAP server before enabling LDAP login.'=>'在启用 LDAP 登录之前，请输入一个基础 DN 和至少一个 LDAP 服务器。','WordPress could not save the settings. Try again.'=>'WordPress 无法保存设置。请重试。','LDAP protocol version'=>'LDAP 协议版本','LDAP timeout'=>'LDAP 超时','Check the submitted settings. No changes were saved.'=>'检查提交的设置。没有保存任何更改。','Check %s. No changes were saved.'=>'检查 %s。没有保存任何更改。']];